## Parent properties

Access properties of the parent object with two points `..` (or more)

```cdata
{
  "country": "France",
  "movie": {
    "name": "Inception", 
    "sub": {
      "a" : "test"
    }
  }
}
```

```ctemplate
{d.movie.sub..name}
{d.movie.sub...country}
```

```cresult
Inception
France
```

